```python
def find_nth_star_number(n):
    for i in range(1, n):
        if n % i == 0:
            sum_of_divisors = 1
            for j in range(1, i):
                if i % j == 0:
                    sum_of_divisors += j
            if sum_of_divisors == n:
                return i
    return None
```

